{"3654570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cube Mind", "steam_appid": 3654570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN US ON DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/de313c4e2b09c32a8cbc1febf4882239.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready to enter a network of futuristic puzzles where every room challenges your intellect. In Cube Mind, every element in the environment is more than just decoration — it’s a strategic tool you must learn to master. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Trigger mechanisms, open doors, and reshape the level by placing cubes with precision. These smart switches react to your actions, ready to set key events in motion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boosters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need to reach new heights? These kinetic modules launch cubes — and even yourself — across the environment. Learn to control their direction and power to solve puzzles with flair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respawners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never worry about losing a cube. These generators ensure you can always reset your strategy and try again without restarting the entire level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lasers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Energy is everything. Redirect laser beams through reflection and precise alignment to unlock new areas. A single millimeter can mean the difference between success and reset.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get ready to enter a network of futuristic puzzles where every room challenges your intellect. In Cube Mind, every element in the environment is more than just decoration — it’s a strategic tool you must learn to master. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Trigger mechanisms, open doors, and reshape the level by placing cubes with precision. These smart switches react to your actions, ready to set key events in motion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boosters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need to reach new heights? These kinetic modules launch cubes — and even yourself — across the environment. Learn to control their direction and power to solve puzzles with flair.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respawners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never worry about losing a cube. These generators ensure you can always reset your strategy and try again without restarting the entire level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lasers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.poster.avif?t=1781547217\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.webm?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.mp4?t=1781547217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Energy is everything. Redirect laser beams through reflection and precise alignment to unlock new areas. A single millimeter can mean the difference between success and reset.</p>", "short_description": "Cube Mind is a challenging first-person puzzle game with a futuristic and minimalist aesthetic. Solve interconnected rooms using logic